  m_Name: Advisor Clive
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Advisor Clive
  offerText: Crime is rising in the city, sir. Allow me to install this solid steel
    personal vault. It requires a fair investment and a sturdy corner, but the peace
    of mind is absolutely unparalleled.
  acceptResultText: The movers drop the massive steel box directly on your foot.
    The lock immediately jams, leaving you with a throbbing toe and a useless, immovable
    iron cube.
  rejectResultText: Clive tips his hat and mutters about your lack of foresight.
    You spend the hour jumping at every creak in the floorboards.
